  "summary": "libjwt vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that libjwt did not use a constant-time comparison when\nverifying HMAC signatures. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue\nto forge signatures through a timing side-channel attack and bypass\nauthentication.",
